# Webview build output
dist/

# Rust / Tauri build output
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# The SEA sidecar is BUILT by build-sea.mjs, never committed (88 MB).
src-tauri/binaries/*.exe

# Generated app icons (produced locally by `cargo tauri icon`). The five files
# tauri.conf.json references are TRACKED: tauri_build's generate_context! (Linux/macOS)
# and its Windows resource step hard-require them, so an ignore of the whole dir makes
# `cargo check` fail on every machine but the one that generated them — measured by the
# 17.0 CI matrix, where all five lanes failed on exactly this. The rest (android/, ios/,
# Square* store logos) stay ignored until a slice needs them.
# NOTE: `dir/` would forbid re-including files inside it — hence `dir/*` + negations.
src-tauri/icons/*
!src-tauri/icons/32x32.png
!src-tauri/icons/128x128.png
!src-tauri/icons/128x128@2x.png
!src-tauri/icons/icon.icns
!src-tauri/icons/icon.ico
